# Russian public copy (КРУГИ)

КРУГИ is a **Russian-speaking** California community platform. Public cards are shown in Russian — not English — regardless of source language (Google Maps, websites, Telegram, paste OCR).

## Hard rule

Any path that **writes** public-facing copy must leave Russian on the card:

- Descriptions («О нас» / «О специалисте»)
- Offer / service / menu titles and blurbs
- Jobs, events, promotions, updates titles and bodies

English (or other Latin-heavy) source stays in `description_original` / `title_original` when those columns exist — for «Показать оригинал» — **not** as the primary public field.

## Implementation (do not invent a parallel translator)

Use the shared gate in [`lib/content/translate-copy-to-ru.ts`](lib/content/translate-copy-to-ru.ts):

- `needsTranslationToRu` — detect Latin-heavy copy (including short titles like «Latte»)
- `resolvePublishNarrative` — entity description on publish / enrich
- `ensureOffersCopyRu` — business offers / professional services / menu items (batch)
- `ensureTitleBodyRu` — jobs, events, promotions, updates

Call these **inside** insert helpers (`addMissingBusinessOffers`, `addMissingProfessionalServices`, `addMissingJobsFromAd`, `addMissingBusinessEvents`, `addMissingEntityPromotions`, `addMissingEntityUpdates`) — not only in one admin UI screen.

## Must not

- Insert English menu/service lines onto a live card «as scraped»
- Skip translation because the source was a photo, Maps, or `/menu` HTML
- Put contacts/addresses into narrative while translating — still run public text through the entity content structure rules

## Brand / person names

Do **not** translate business or person display names (`translateTitle: false` on `resolvePublishNarrative`). Translate descriptions and catalog lines only.
